% Information
% ===========
% For each stock of Dow Jones 30, starting from 1985 up to and
% including Oct. 30th, 2003, daily quotations with open/close and
% adjusted close values, min./max values, volume are submitted.
% The said data are the result of a merge between different CSV
% files, downloaded from www.yahoo.com, as I made it to write my
% dissertation at the Dept. of Computer Science of University of
% Turin, Italy with Rosa Meo Prof. Data format is as follows. ID
% (Unique Identifier); date; open; high; low; volume; adjclose;
% ticker. Submitted by Danilo Careggio
% (careggio.danilo@tiscali.it) [6/Feb/04] (2.3M)
%
% Note: - Information about dataset from here
%         http://lib.stat.cmu.edu/datasets/
%       - description of columns didn't match data, hence guessed
%
%
% Information about the dataset
% CLASSTYPE: numeric
% CLASSINDEX: none specific
%

@relation dj30-1985-2003

@attribute ID INTEGER
@attribute date DATE d-MMM-yy
@attribute open REAL
@attribute high REAL
@attribute low REAL
@attribute volume REAL
@attribute ticker INTEGER
@attribute adjclose REAL
@attribute stock {aa,axp,bs,cat,ci,co,dd,dis,ek,ge,gm,hd,hon,hpq,ibm,intc,ip,jnj,jpm,mcd,mmm,mo,mrk,msft,pg,sbc,t,utx,wmt,xom}

